    "raw": "by Hiraki Corale, Hylotl Adventurer\nDue to my frequent attempts at cultural sensitivity, I decided to try and integrate myself with my hosts even more. While exploring the castle, I found a number of decorative suits of armour that appear to depict warrior Glitch. Naturally, to make my companions comfortable, I put a set on.",
    "value": "由鲛人探险家平木·圣咏所著\n鉴于我时常努力展现文化敏感性，我决定更进一步地融入我的东道主们。在探索城堡时，我发现了一些装饰性盔甲，它们似乎描绘的是电子人战士的形象。自然而然地，为了令我的伙伴们感到亲切，我穿上了一副。"
