    "raw": "The armour was hard to walk in, so I lost my balance a few times. I came tumbling down the stairs and into the main hall, and all Glitch eyes were on me. Rather than the warm greeting I deserved, however, they began to chatter and yell. I heard the words 'Anger' and 'Disgust' a number of times. And then they began to chase me.",
    "value": "这盔甲着实难以行走，以至于我数次失去平衡。我就这么跌跌撞撞地滚下楼梯，闯进了大厅，霎时间所有电子人的目光都聚焦在我身上。然而，我并未得到应得的热情问候，取而代之的是一片哗然与叫嚷。我数次听到“愤怒”与“厌恶”这两个词。接着，他们便开始追赶我。"
